            <ArticleTitle>van der Waals Metal-Organic Framework as an Excitonic Material for Advanced Photonics.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201606034</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Synergistic combination of organic and inorganic nature in van der Waals metal-organic frameworks supports different types of robust excitons that can be effectively and independently manipulated by light at room temperature, and opens new concepts for all-optical data processing and storage.</AbstractText>
